#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/contrib/cutedsl/rand/index.rst:2
msgid "tilelang.contrib.cutedsl.rand"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/contrib/cutedsl/rand/index.rst:8
msgid "Philox4x32-10 random numbers for the CuTeDSL backend."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/contrib/cutedsl/rand/index.rst:10
msgid ""
"This is a port of the ``curandStatePhilox4_32_10_t`` part of "
"``curand_kernel.h``. The generator state lives in a 16-word register array "
"because it has to survive across conditional code, which is how curand keeps "
"it in a local struct."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/contrib/cutedsl/rand/index.rst:15
msgid ""
"Integers and uniform floats reproduce curand bit for bit. The normals run "
"the same Box-Muller transform with the same cached sibling and the same fast "
"sin/cos, but that approximation is not bit-identical to curand's "
"``__sincosf`` for every input, and the double pair uses ``sincospi``, which "
"CuTeDSL does not expose; both agree to a few ulps and the generator position "
"always matches."
msgstr ""

