#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/contrib/cutedsl/rand/index.rst:60
msgid ""
"The 64-bit uniform store is the one place where curand's vector helper is "
"not the elementwise composition of its scalar form: it takes 53-bit samples "
"from a whole Philox block instead of one 32-bit word per result."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/contrib/cutedsl/rand/index.rst:69
msgid ""
"curand's vector helpers generate a fresh pair and keep the scalar Box-Muller "
"cache as it is, so a later scalar draw still returns its sibling."
msgstr ""
